# Frontend build

When you change anything under `frontend/` (source, `public/`, Vite config, etc.), before finishing the task run a production build from the frontend package:

```bash
cd frontend
npm run build
```

If the build fails, fix the errors and re-run until it passes. This keeps `frontend/dist` aligned with what Hostinger or static deploy expects.
